  "summary": "awxkit has a path traversal vulnerability",
  "details": "A path traversal vulnerability was found in awxkit, the CLI tool for AWX. The YAML !include directive does not sanitize file paths, allowing an attacker to craft a malicious YAML file that reads arbitrary YAML-formatted files from the local filesystem when a user imports it using \"awx --conf.format yaml import\". This is a client-side vulnerability requiring user interaction.",
